    {
      "id": "claim_7963cda53c6a4478835ce2ab64bf7d41",
      "statement": "Brijio configuration is environment-driven via .env/process env. Key variables include WEBSOCKET_HOST/PORT (0.0.0.0/8787), BRIJIO_WS_URL (ws://127.0.0.1:8787), BRIJIO_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS (5000), BRIJIO_PAIRING_TOKEN (auto-generated), MCP_HTTP_HOST/PORT/PATH (0.0.0.0/8788//mcp), MCP_HTTP_AUTH_TOKEN (auto-generated), MCP_HTTP_ALLOWED_ORIGINS, and TEST_PAGE_PORT (8080). Tokens are generated with crypto.randomBytes(32).toString('base64url') when unset/placeholder, and BROWSERBRIDGE_* names are accepted as backwards-compatible aliases resolved via a fallback chain.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.env.example",
