      "id": "claim_8f35e9216ea642e2854d02dc2d04cd66",
      "statement": "pnpm dev runs scripts/dev.mjs, which classifies the .env (placeholders/incomplete/configured), generates tokens when needed, spawns the WS and MCP servers under tsx watch, polls GET /health on both (every 500ms, 15s timeout, probing 127.0.0.1 for 0.0.0.0 binds) before printing a banner, supervises children with a 2s-backoff restart (max 5 attempts), and performs graceful shutdown (SIGTERM then SIGKILL after 5s) on SIGINT/SIGTERM. Non-interactive mode is triggered by --yes/-y or CI=true.",
