    {
      "id": "claim_e700cbccce314a4baf87e7b5493df481",
      "statement": "The current MCP HTTP server implements only Origin validation via MCP_HTTP_ALLOWED_ORIGINS; there is no Host-header allow-list in http-server.ts. The MCP_HTTP_ALLOWED_HOSTS, MCP_HTTP_ALLOW_TAILSCALE_HOSTS, and MCP_HTTP_ALLOW_LOCAL_HOSTS variables described in ADRs 0025/0026 are not read by the current server, consistent with ADR 0035's proposal to rely on the bearer token alone.",
