      "id": "claim_32ffc04f3b1c4ae0910fa7e758a8915e",
      "statement": "The root Dockerfile is a multi-stage build producing a single image running both servers under s6-overlay v3. A single s6 longrun service (docker/s6-rc.d/brijio) runs `node dist/bin/brijio.js` (the combined entry point), registered in the s6 user bundle, with ENTRYPOINT /init, EXPOSE 8787 8788, and default ENV for hosts/ports/WS URL/timeout. Tokens auto-generate when empty and print to stdout.",
      "evidence": [
