    {
      "id": "claim_843845564d8742e8b077fece9e1bc479",
      "statement": "In the combined Docker image the MCP server connects to the WebSocket server on loopback (ws://127.0.0.1:8787) since both share one container network namespace, requiring no Docker Compose hostname resolution. The image defaults to 0.0.0.0 binding because 127.0.0.1 inside a container is unreachable from the host even with -p port mapping; strictly local-only access requires npx or docker run --network=host.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L70-L85",
