    {
      "id": "claim_2ce9dbfdd77e489d8884ed6ecf2dfd4f",
      "statement": "Daemon lifecycle subcommands map to platform tooling: start/stop/restart use launchctl load/unload on macOS and systemctl --user start/stop/restart on Linux; status probes launchctl list / systemctl is-active plus both /health endpoints and reports config/binary paths; logs uses tail/tail -f of ~/.brijio/brijio.log on macOS and journalctl --user -u brijio.service / --follow on Linux. uninstall stops and removes the service link but preserves ~/.brijio/.",
