    {
      "id": "claim_fb15e1acc92e4e319679b9e93d9944a0",
      "statement": "The bin entry point loads .env via loadBrijioEnv checking in order BRIJIO_ENV_FILE, CWD/.env, then ~/.brijio/.env; applyBrijioEnv only sets values the process environment doesn't already define, so explicit env vars take precedence over .env. The daemon's WorkingDirectory is ~/.brijio so it always finds its config.",
