    {
      "id": "claim_3ffcbe70b350453c901bd9c3f6872a89",
      "statement": "The brijio binary's run modes include interactive foreground run, `demo` (both servers on 127.0.0.1 plus a static demo page on 0.0.0.0, attaching to an existing healthy daemon to avoid port/pairing-token conflicts), `--dev` (bind both servers to 127.0.0.1), `--print-config [agent]` and `--doctor` (which import server modules dynamically only in run mode), and `--version`/`-v`. EADDRINUSE on startup is caught and reported with a pointer to --doctor and port-override env vars.",
