          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:b28ceedcd2adc5ebc55bc11fd7f4e46aa9b26e7bf6ae60ea608136d46804b39c"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_56784dc23c544326a5257fb6d0856edf",
      "statement": "The release workflow publishes npm and Docker after release validation: publish-npm (Node 24) verifies servers/mcp is @brijio/mcp at the release version, skips if npm view shows it exists, and runs `npm publish --access public --provenance --no-git-checks` using OIDC trusted publishing (permissions: id-token: write). publish-docker (gated on release and publish-npm) builds and pushes the root Dockerfile to Docker Hub as <user>/mcp:<version> plus :latest for non-prerelease versions.",
