      "statement": "The WebSocket relay exists only to bridge the MCP server and browser extensions and is never deployed without the MCP server; every distribution mode (pnpm dev, npx, Docker, daemon) starts both servers together, and the combined entry point connects the MCP server to the WS server on loopback.",
